OL,3,GNEWSACat reunited with owners six years
OL,4,Aafter going missing in car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pet cat has been reunited with its
OL,7,Fowners - six years after going missing
OL,8,Fin a car crash while they were moving
OL,9,Fhouse.
OL,11,FPandora escaped when Billy Bowie was
OL,12,Finvolved in a collision in Perthshire
OL,13,Fin 2020, while relocating from Essex to
OL,14,FAberdeenshire.
OL,16,FBilly and his wife Mary returned to the
OL,17,Fscene of the accident to search for
OL,18,Ftheir beloved pet - but it wasn't until
OL,19,Flast month that they learned she had
OL,20,Fbeen found.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
